OL,4,BWatford appoint Iordanescu as head     
OL,5,Bcoach                                  
OL,6,GWatford have appointed former Romania  
OL,7,Gboss Edward Iordanescu as the          
OL,8,GChampionship club's new head coach.    
OL,10,FThe 48-year-old replaces Alessio       
OL,11,FDionisi, who was sacked on Sunday      
OL,12,Fafter only five months in charge       
OL,13,Ffollowing a run of seven defeats in    
OL,14,Ftheir past 10 league games,            
OL,15,Fculminating in Saturday's 4-0 loss to  
OL,16,FSheffield United.                      
OL,18,F"I am very proud and happy to be at    
OL,19,Fthis football club," Iordanescu told   
OL,20,Fthe club website.                      
